      "body": "Installed Tor 0.4.9.12 and tested against it with `HashedControlPassword` for `pa\\ss\"word\\`: on master bitcoind gets \"tor: Authentication failed\", with this change authentication succeeds and ADD_ONION creates the service. I'll ask in #35292 how to combine the test coverage. ",
